    'Real GDP 2016 في مثال السلايدات يساوي…':['Real GDP in 2016 in the slide example equals…',['$100m','$160m','$300m','$18,282bn'],'2016 quantities valued at 2009 prices equal $160 million.'],
    'أي شيء لا يظهر جيدًا في GDP؟':['Which item is not well captured by GDP?',['Government expenditure','New investment','Leisure time','Exports'],'Leisure time is not valued in GDP.'],
